# Environment variables are defined per app — see:
#   apps/orchestrator/.env.example  — CLōD + PORT + optional Supabase persistence
#
# Web (`apps/web`): set ORCHESTRATOR_URL if the UI/API proxy should not use
# http://127.0.0.1:3001. Optional NEXT_PUBLIC_* Supabase vars only if the
# browser talks to Supabase directly (not required for orchestrator persistence).
